ose friend, and she lived with us. Her daughter was married to Duke Ellington. Whenever he came to town, he'd always come to the house and have dinner. I met him long before I got involved musically, but I got to know him from him coming to my aunt's house to have dinner. I met him for the first time that way. Then ...", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q15327$3EA5A98E-DE36-4370-AE5B-977BA58DFAD4", "rank": "normal"}], "P20": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P20", "hash": "0e3a1415ab15f65d8d31cce626f489d56e14a9c4", "datavalue": {"value": "https://semlab.s3.amazonaws.com/texts/1f2804a3842d7b049f6f52cbbf3a7e3c/378.txt", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "url"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q15327$47C34494-E17B-4AEA-B812-C34092B7BF35", "rank": "normal"}], "P21": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "f44662a78c69afa19b69a47805ad4df373539269", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 64, "id": "Q64"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q15327$DE177DB6-33D1-4781-80B0-FFB3E9998E5B", "rank": "normal"}], "P22": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P22", "hash": "88e0f28e7fec3b1378989f4a606548ba1f2517a8", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 255, "id": "Q255"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q15327$E1319642-10DD-47BF-81EF-2ABB863FE088", "rank": "normal"}], "P23": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P23", "hash": "ae8ad19d0d891bd0f6e54bd253935226a58ff651", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 255, "id": "Q255"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q15327$FA029279-4F6B-4209-A77D-620BEB3BD346", "rank": "normal"}]}}